  m_Name: Event_GravityWell
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: event.gravity-well
  displayName: Gravity Well
  <Body>k__BackingField: The jump drops you into a gravity well around a dead star.
    Breaking free will cost you something.
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - Label: Burn the engines hard
    Requirement: 0
    RequiredScraps: 0
    Chance: 1
    Outcomes:
    - Kind: 1
      Amount: -20
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    FailOutcomes: []
    ResultText: The hull shrieks, but you tear free.
    FailText: 
  - Label: Jettison salvage
    Requirement: 0
    RequiredScraps: 0
    Chance: 1
    Outcomes:
    - Kind: 0
      Amount: -30
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    FailOutcomes: []
    ResultText: Lighter, you slip out of the well.
    FailText: 
  - Label: Slingshot around the core
    Requirement: 0
    RequiredScraps: 0
    Chance: 0.5
    Outcomes:
    - Kind: 4
      Amount: 20
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    FailOutcomes:
    - Kind: 1
      Amount: -35
      Rarity: 0
      Stat: 0
    ResultText: You whip around the core and come out trailing Dark Matter.
    FailText: The core nearly swallows you. You claw your way out, barely.
